        "type": "writing",
        "title": "The map below shows a school in 1985 and the school now. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><strong>The map below shows a school in 1985 and the school now. </strong></em></span><em style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1: School Development Since 1985</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-ZE0EderokonhrdxOGQOlbqckg8g\">Đề b&agrave;i School Development since 1985 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về sự biến đổi của một trường học từ năm 1985 đến hiện tại.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-K5pSdLrQpoF8acxi6Wrln1gigeg\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề School Development since 1985 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: bố cục của trường học năm 1985 v&agrave;&nbsp;<strong>cấu h&igrave;nh hiện tại</strong> <em>(current configuration)</em>, cho thấy <strong>sự ph&aacute;t triển</strong> <em>(developments)</em> đ&atilde; diễn ra trong giai đoạn n&agrave;y.</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JEbsd2QXSos0HUxGNcHlF0ntgab\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HVebdDKPDoNbSExDutel4LdQgeo\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BVeFdLujWon2cIxTpmRl2ZVLgsd\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup> &copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề Maps School Development since 1985, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh đưa ra c&aacute;i nh&igrave;n tổng quan về những thay đổi ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YQUxd3mvZoD9CDxfOjBlqNLhgke\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Trường học đ&atilde; trải qua <strong>sự mở rộng v&agrave; hiện đại h&oacute;a</strong> <em>(expansion and modernization)</em> đ&aacute;ng kể c&ugrave;ng với sự gia tăng lớn trong số lượng học sinh.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LrvwdVy5RovqYhxL1lnlpIZXglb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Những thay đổi đ&aacute;ng ch&uacute; &yacute;</strong> nhất bao gồm <strong>việc hợp nhất b&atilde;i đỗ xe</strong> <em>(parking consolidation)</em>, <strong>mở rộng t&ograve;a nh&agrave;</strong> <em>(building expansions)</em>, v&agrave; <strong>bổ sung cơ sở vật chất mới</strong> <em>(new facility additions)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WLkcdtYmdoCbPRx82yGlwGHNgjc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework <sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i School Development since 1985 một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch<strong> chia c&aacute;c thay đổi theo vị tr&iacute; địa l&yacute;</strong><em> (geographical location)</em></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P06AdwVAioetUFx6MzilxCvvgvf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yu4MdOZ1JoLYsQxGQNRlpNuOgsb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MfFWd7rzNoOfyax6As5l5WbjgPb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DA9Wd4PctodTUwxgjellSqICgId\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>Ph&iacute;a t&acirc;y</strong> <em>(western side)</em></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ToXUd7OVloDhT2xGN2TlViYmgWf\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework <sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PGn9dWCkloztOpxEaUalvhrQgwg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>T&aacute;i cấu tr&uacute;c</strong> <em>(restructuring)</em> lớn đ&atilde; diễn ra với việc hợp nhất hai b&atilde;i đỗ xe ri&ecirc;ng biệt th&agrave;nh một <strong>b&atilde;i đỗ xe h&igrave;nh b&aacute;n nguyệt duy nhất</strong> <em>(single semi-circular car park)</em> ở khu vực ph&iacute;a bắc.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M0McdpOdoo7PPOxXeJrlIswbgie\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Thư viện ban đầu đ&atilde; được thay thế bằng <strong>Trung t&acirc;m T&agrave;i nguy&ecirc;n Học tập</strong> <em>(Learning Resources Centre)</em> với ph&ograve;ng m&aacute;y t&iacute;nh, trong khi <strong>c&aacute;c lớp học liền kề</strong> <em>(adjacent classrooms)</em> đ&atilde; được mở rộng.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CwmedSquYofXiSxPkSQlTcIfgLb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&aacute;c cơ sở giải tr&iacute; mới</strong> <em>(new recreational facilities)</em> bao gồm hồ bơi v&agrave; trung t&acirc;m thể dục đ&atilde; được x&acirc;y dựng ở <strong>g&oacute;c t&acirc;y nam</strong> <em>(southwestern corner).</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcskdIE6RoFckExwCkClFQLsglf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UcPzdqFBqofBD1xRL88lNtv5gP1\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GXVUdjVVKo0SA1xuZW1l8Varggb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2: </strong><strong>Khu vực trung t&acirc;m v&agrave; ph&iacute;a đ&ocirc;ng</strong> <em>(central and eastern areas)</em></span></h4>\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CukidyNrIoQwqcxtutilZIQvgNg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Con đường nội bộ</strong> <em>(internal road)</em> kết nối s&acirc;n chơi với b&atilde;i đỗ xe đ&atilde; được <strong>loại bỏ v&agrave; thay thế</strong> <em>(removed and replaced)</em> bằng c&acirc;y xanh</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P089dApRBopmFExS7xLlmtU4gAh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>C&aacute;c lớp học đ&atilde; trải qua <strong>sự mở rộng đ&aacute;ng kể</strong> <em>(substantial expansion)</em>, với <strong>khối hai tầng </strong><em>(two-storey block)</em> ban đầu được <strong>mở rộng l&ecirc;n ba tầng</strong> <em>(extended to three storeys)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L7QId2Os8oE0ynx69qzlVc7NgZb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">h&ocirc;ng gian lớp học bổ sung đ&atilde; được x&acirc;y dựng tr&ecirc;n&nbsp;<strong>đất trước đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một phần của s&acirc;n chơi</strong> <em>(land previously part of the playing fields)</em>, do đ&oacute; diện t&iacute;ch s&acirc;n chơi đ&atilde; bị thu hẹp đ&aacute;ng kể để <strong>ph&ugrave; hợp với sự ph&aacute;t triển mới n&agrave;y</strong> <em>(accommodate this development)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 2016,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p>The maps illustrate the layout of a school in 1985 and its current configuration, showing the developments that have taken place over this period.</p>",
            "question_id": 18748,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2017,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<p>Overall, the school has undergone significant expansion and modernization, along with a major increase in the student population. The most notable changes include parking consolidation, building expansions, and new facility additions.</p>",
            "question_id": 18748,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2018,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p>On the western side, major restructuring has occurred. In 1985, there were two separate car parks: a main rectangular one and a smaller one between the road and classrooms. These have been merged into a single semi-circular car park in the northern area. The original library has been replaced by a Learning Resources Centre with a computer room, while adjacent classrooms have been expanded. New recreational facilities including a pool and fitness centre have been constructed in the southwestern corner.</p>",
            "question_id": 18748,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2019,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p>Regarding the central and eastern areas, the internal road connecting the playing fields to the car park has been removed and replaced with trees. The classroom facilities have undergone substantial expansion, with the original two-storey block extended to three storeys. Additional classroom space has been constructed on land previously part of the playing fields. Consequently, while the playing fields remain at the southern end, their area has been considerably reduced to accommodate this development.</p>",
            "question_id": 18748,
            "is_toggle_on": true
